# CC-CEDICT patch entries
# Format: traditional simplified [pin1 yin1] /definition/
#
# Words the syllabus teaches that CC-CEDICT lacks, or says less about than the
# syllabus means, from hsk-syllabus-vocabulary-parser's patch. A line whose heading
# CC-CEDICT also has merges into that entry; one it has caught up with is dropped
# here, or the card would say the same thing twice.
不予 不予 [bu4 yu3] /to not grant/to refuse/to withhold/
壓軸 压轴 [ya1 zhou4] /opera term: to present the second to last item in a theatrical performance/
精彩紛呈 精彩纷呈 [jing1 cai3 fen1 cheng2] /idiom: wonderful scenes or performances appearing one after another/remarkable and varied in succession/
口哨兒 口哨儿 [kou3 shao4 r5] /whistle (sound made by pursing the lips)/to whistle (吹口哨儿)/
# At the syllabus's reading, where CC-CEDICT files the sense under another: that is
# what lets the word's entry be chosen by reading.
嗯 嗯 [ng4] /interjection indicating approval, appreciation or agreement/
泄露 泄露 [xie4 lou4] /to leak (information); to divulge/also pr. [xie4lou4]/

# Senses CC-CEDICT's own entry lacks for the meaning the syllabus teaches, in English
# Wiktionary's wording; each merges into the CC-CEDICT entry of the same headword.
