易於 易于 [yi4 yu2] /to be apt to; to be easy to/

# Written for this deck, not taken from a dictionary. CC-CEDICT and English Wiktionary
# give 底蕴 only as "inside information"; the syllabus teaches it as the depth a culture
# or a person has built up, as in 文化底蕴.
底蘊 底蕴 [di3 yun4] /deep foundation; accumulated depth (of culture, learning etc)/

